@host = http://127.0.0.1:5000
@cattleId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

# Run AnimalLifecycle.http first to create the disposable fixture.

### Read history — expected 200, including for deleted fixture
GET {{host}}/animal/{{lifecycleAnimalId}}/status-changes
Accept: application/json

### Invalid page — expected 400
GET {{host}}/animal/{{lifecycleAnimalId}}/status-changes?page=0
Accept: application/json

### Oversized page — expected 400
GET {{host}}/animal/{{lifecycleAnimalId}}/status-changes?pageSize=101
Accept: application/json
